   "type": "img",
   "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjA3MDNfNjkg/MDAxNzgzMDUzODMzNjIy.BRTbn5QkjSjVNkRJ3UR36Q5O0nGZzwvYR63tGN_VGJcg.BYIpf5t8UpG9YYb-_R-qmGncaVMIzl-pjU4zWR1HoIEg.JPEG/900_20260624_183447.jpg?type=w400",
   "alt": ""
  },
  {
   "type": "img",
   "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjA3MDNfODgg/MDAxNzgzMDU0MDU3OTgw.dJu1BmlJfq_Ws_XO7ptIc16ZIj3q5aaW17vWVxl4QoYg.wAuf0Cn_rNXFD3pHN5HxhmsnV_XuK7ERyiq9VMxGSlkg.PNG/image.png?type=w400",
   "alt": ""
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "생각보다 훨씬 가격이 저렴하죠?"
